message: If you use the FabaBase phenotype database format or its validator, please cite it as below.
type: software
title: FabaBase phenotype database format
abstract: >-
  A format of linked tables for phenotype data from plant experiments, with a validator, guides for converting
  data into it, and scripts that publish datasets in it on Zenodo.
